  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759151,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 100 Classic Books: The Strange Case of Dr. Jekyll and Mr. Hyde - Nintendo DS\n\nDelve into Robert Louis Stevenson's chilling novella, *The Strange Case of Dr. Jekyll and Mr. Hyde*, as part of the innovative 100 Classic Books collection for the Nintendo DS. Experience this gripping tale of a respected London doctor who unleashes his darker side through a dangerous experiment, transforming into the malevolent Mr. Hyde. \n\nThis e-book collection reimagines reading for the digital age. Hold your DS like a traditional book and navigate the story using the touch screen, adjusting text size and background music to create your ideal reading environment. Utilize the bookmark feature to save your progress and easily resume where you left off.  \n\nBeyond the narrative, explore author introductions and utilize the search function to discover other literary gems within the collection.  Discover your literary preferences with the in-game quiz, and share \"trial versions\" with friends via local Wi-Fi.  Experience a classic tale brought to life on a portable platform, offering a unique and engaging way to appreciate timeless literature."
    },
